he average of 8 numbers is 25. If one number, 32, is replaced by 44, what will be the new average?

A) 25.5
B) 26
C) 26.5
D) 27

Answer: B) 26

Explanation:

Original total:

$$ 8\times25=200 $$

The number 32 is replaced by 44:

$$ \text{New total}=200-32+44=212 $$

New average:

8
212
	​

=
26
	​
